mibold tracking-tight">System Baseline &amp; Architecture Specification Protocol: PS-003 Standard</p></div><div class="flex items-center gap-space-md"><span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant uppercase tracking-wider">Architecture: Decentralized Edge</span><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-tertiary-container bg-surface-container-lowest px-2 py-0.5 rounded"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-on-tertiary-container"></span>Production Ready</span></div></div></div><div class="p-space-margin-desktop space-y-space-xl"><div class="bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl p-space-lg shadow-sm"><div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-center justify-between gap-space-lg"><div class="space-y-space-xs max-w-3xl"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-space-xs"><span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm bg-secondary/10 text-secondary px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase">Category: Smart Cities</span><span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm bg-surface-container text-on-surface-variant px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-mono">PS-003</span><span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface px-2 py-0.5 rounded uppercase font-semibold text-xs tracking-wider">System Architecture &amp; Citations</span></div><h1 class="font-headline-xl text-headline-xl text-on-surface tracking-tight">System Architecture Features, Operational Benefits &amp; Open-Source Foundation</h1><p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">Comprehensive architectural breakdown, real-world deployment benefits, empirical advantages over centralized telemetry, and open-source benchmark dataset &amp; model references.</p></div><div class="flex flex-row lg:flex-col items-center lg:items-end justify-between gap-space-sm bg-surface-container-low p-space-md rounded-lg"><div class="text-left lg:text-right"><div class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant">BANDWIDTH EFFICIENCY</div><div class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-secondary font-bold">99.8%</div></div><div class="w-32 lg:w-44 bg-surface-container-highest h-2 rounded-full overflow-hidden"><div class="bg-secondary h-full w-full"></div></div><span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-tertiary-container font-semibold">Zero Sensor Video Leakage</span></div></div></div><div class="bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl p-space-lg shadow-sm space-y-space-lg"><div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-space-sm pb-space-sm border-b border-surface-container"><div><div class="flex items-center gap-space-xs"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-[22px]">memory</span><h2 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface tracking-tight">Core Technical Features Matrix</h2></div><p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-1">Algorithmic foundations designed strictly for smart urban traffic control and localized edge parameter synchronization.</p></div><span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm font-mono text-on-surface-variant bg-surface-container-low px-2 py-1 rounded">4 Core Subsystems</span></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-space-md"><div class="bg-surface-container-low rounded-lg p-space-md flex flex-col justify-between relative overflow-hidden"><div class="space-y-space-xs"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-secondary font-bold">SUBSYSTEM 01</span><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-[20px]">schedule</span></div><h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface font-semibold">Chronological Split Engine</h3><p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Guarantees absolute zero temporal data leakage by strictly partitioning forward temporal validation sequences (T_train &lt; T_val &lt; T_test) across all roadside intersection nodes.</p></div><div class="mt-space-md pt-space-xs bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-xs rounded"><div class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant">Leakage Bound:</div><div class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-tertiary-container font-mono font-semibold">Strict Causal Isolation</div></div></div><div class="bg-surface-container-low rounded-lg p-space-md flex flex-col justify-between relative overflow-hidden"><div class="space-y-space-xs"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-secondary font-bold">SUBSYSTEM 02</span><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-[20px]">tune</span></div><h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface font-semibold">Dirichlet Non-IID Synthesizer</h3><p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Configurable Dirichlet distribution partition (α = 0.1 to 1.0) modeling severe real-world arterial skew between congested commercial hubs and quiet residential junctions.</p></div><div class="mt-space-md pt-space-xs bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-xs rounded"><div class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant">Parameter Range:</div><div class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-secondary font-mono font-semibold">Dirichlet α ∈ [0.1, 1.0]</div></div></div><div class="bg-surface-container-low rounded-lg p-space-md flex flex-col justify-between relative overflow-hidden"><div class="space-y-space-xs"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-secondary font-bold">SUBSYSTEM 03</span><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-[20px]">compress</span></div><h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface font-semibold">Quantized Compact Weight Exchange</h3><p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Bi-directional FP16/INT8 delta serialization sending only 42.8 KB model weight tensors instead of multi-gigabyte raw loop detector or optical video feeds.</p></div><div class="mt-space-md pt-space-xs bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-xs rounded"><div class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant">Bandwidth Conservation:</div><div class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-tertiary-container font-mono font-semibold">99.8% Payload Reduction</div></div></div><div class="bg-surface-container-low rounded-lg p-space-md flex flex-col justify-between relative overflow-hidden"><div class="space-y-space-xs"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-secondary font-bold">SUBSYSTEM 04</span><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-[20px]">balance</span></div><h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface font-semibold">Edge-Resilient FedAvg Aggregator</h3><p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Robust sample-weighted aggregation (w_k = n_k / N) enhanced with adaptive cosine drift clipping to prevent model divergence from intermittently dropped edge nodes.</p></div><div class="mt-space-md pt-space-xs bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-xs rounded"><div class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant">Aggregation Rule:</div><div class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-primary font-mono font-semibold">w_k = n_k / N + Cosine Clip</div></div></div></div></div><div class="bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl p-space-lg shadow-sm space-y-space-lg"><div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-space-sm pb-space-sm border-b border-surface-container"><div><div class="flex items-center gap-space-xs"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-[22px]">energy_savings_leaf</span><h2 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface tracking-tight">Operational &amp; Smart City Benefits</h2></div><p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-1">Quantitative municipal advantages over legacy cloud-centric streaming telemetry.</p></div><span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-tertiary-container bg-surface-container-low px-2 py-1 rounded font-semibold">Real-World Impact Validated</span></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-space-md"><div class="p-space-md bg-surface-container-low rounded-lg flex flex-col justify-between space-y-space-sm"><div class="space-y-space-xs"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><div class="flex items-center gap-space-xs"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-[20px]">signal_cellular_alt</span><h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface font-semibold">Extreme Bandwidth &amp; Cellular Cost Reduction</h3></div><span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm bg-surface-container-lowest px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-on-tertiary-container font-bold">-99.8% Backhaul</span></div><p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Traditional centralized municipal telemetry inverts cellular budgets by uploading continuous sensor streams totaling ~14.8 GB/day per junction. FedTraffic edge parameter sync limits data exchange to 28.8 MB/day across all 50 federated rounds.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-space-xs bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-sm rounded font-label-sm text-label-sm"><div class="border-r border-surface-container"><span class="text-on-surface-variant block">Central Ingest</span><span class="font-semibold text-error">14.8 GB / day</span></div><div><span class="text-on-surface-variant block">Federated Sync</span><span class="font-semibold text-on-tertiary-container">28.8 MB / day</span></div></div></div><div class="p-space-md bg-surface-container-low rounded-lg flex flex-col justify-between space-y-space-sm"><div class="space-y-space-xs"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><div class="flex items-center gap-space-xs"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-[20px]">shield</span><h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface font-semibold">Edge Data Locality &amp; Commuter Privacy</h3></div><span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm bg-surface-container-lowest px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-on-tertiary-container font-bold">Zero Optical Egress</span></div><p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">High-definition vehicle video feeds, timestamped optical frames, and plate numbers never leave the local roadside units (RSUs). Only ephemeral gradients and model updates are shared, guaranteeing physical data sovereignty and compliance with strict privacy statutes.</p></div><div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-sm rounded flex items-center justify-between font-label-sm text-label-sm"><span class="text-on-surface-variant">Raw Video / Plate Data Transmission</span><span class="font-mono font-semibold text-on-tertiary-container">0 Bytes (Confined to RSU)</span></div></div><div class="p-space-md bg-surface-container-low rounded-lg flex flex-col justify-between space-y-space-sm"><div class="space-y-space-xs"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><div class="flex items-center gap-space-xs"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-[20px]">alt_route</span><h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface font-semibold">Hyper-Localized Traffic Responsiveness</h3></div><span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm bg-surface-container-lowest px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-secondary font-bold">Adaptive Weights</span></div><p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Accommodates acute Non-IID skew between differing road morphologies (arterial highways vs urban city centers). Local fine-tuning retains high micro-accuracy for intersection-specific signal timing while benefiting from regional congestion trend vectors.</p></div><div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-sm rounded flex items-center justify-between font-label-sm text-label-sm"><span class="text-on-surface-variant">Prediction Resolution</span><span class="font-mono font-semibold text-secondary">15-min horizon (4.12 - 6.84 MAE)</span></div></div><div class="p-space-md bg-surface-container-low rounded-lg flex flex-col justify-between space-y-space-sm"><div class="space-y-space-xs"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><div class="flex items-center gap-space-xs"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-[20px]">sensors_off</span><h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface font-semibold">Low-Latency Autonomous Decision Making</h3></div><span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm bg-surface-container-lowest px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-on-tertiary-container font-bold">Offline Resilient</span></div><p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Unlike centralized cloud controllers that halt or degrade during backhaul outages or cellular storms, local edge units execute sub-10ms inference using on-device GRU weights to sustain autonomous adaptive signal phasing indefinitely.</p></div><div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-sm rounded flex items-center justify-between font-label-sm text-label-sm"><span class="text-on-surface-variant">Edge Inference Latency</span><span class="font-mono font-semibold text-on-tertiary-container">&lt; 8.2 ms / cycle (FP16)</span></div></div></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-space-lg"><div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-space-lg"><div class="bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl p-space-lg shadow-sm space-y-space-md"><div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-space-xs border-b border-surface-container"><div><h2 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface font-semibold">Benchmark Datasets &amp; Open Data Foundation</h2><p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Curated open-access traffic flow sensor time-series used for standardization and evaluation.</p></div><span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm font-mono text-secondary bg-surface-container px-2 py-1 rounded">Caltrans / DOT</span></div><div class="overflow-x-auto"><table class="w-full text-left font-label-md text-label-md"><thead><tr class="bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface-variant font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase"><th class="py-2 px-3">Benchmark Dataset</th><th class="py-2 px-3">Domain / Sensors</th><th class="py-2 px-3">Interval</th><th class="py-2 px-3 text-right">License</th></tr></thead><tbody class="divide-y divide-surface-container"><tr><td class="py-2.5 px-3 font-semibold text-on-surface"><div class="flex items-center gap-1"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-secondary">database</span>METR-LA</div><span class="font-body-sm text-on-surface-variant text-xs">Los Angeles County Highways</span></td><td class="py-2.5 px-3 font-mono text-on-surface-variant text-xs">207 Loop Detectors</td><td class="py-2.5 px-3 font-mono text-xs">5-min (Agg. 15-min)</td><td class="py-2.5 px-3 text-right font-mono text-xs text-on-tertiary-container">CC BY 4.0</td></tr><tr><td class="py-2.5 px-3 font-semibold text-on-surface"><div class="flex items-center gap-1"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-secondary">database</span>PeMS-BAY</div><span class="font-body-sm text-on-surface-variant text-xs">San Francisco Bay Area DOT</span></td><td class="py-2.5 px-3 font-mono text-on-surface-variant text-xs">325 Roadside Stations</td><td class="py-2.5 px-3 font-mono text-xs">5-min (Agg. 15-min)</td><td class="py-2.5 px-3 text-right font-mono text-xs text-on-tertiary-container">Open Academic</td></tr><tr><td class="py-2.5 px-3 font-semibold text-on-surface"><div class="flex items-center gap-1"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-secondary">database</span>AIORI-3 PS-003 Micro</div><span class="font-body-sm text-on-surface-variant text-xs">Synthetic Non-IID Dirichlet Intersections</span></td><td class="py-2.5 px-3 font-mono text-on-surface-variant text-xs">5 Virtual Intersection Nodes</td><td class="py-2.5 px-3 font-mono text-xs">15-min Horizon</td><td class="py-2.5 px-3 text-right font-mono text-xs text-secondary">AIORI Standard</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="space-y-space-xs pt-space-xs"><h4 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface font-semibold text-sm">Underlying Model Architectures Cited</h4><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-space-xs font-body-sm text-body-sm"><div class="p-space-xs bg-surface-container-low rounded border border-surface-container"><span class="font-semibold text-on-surface block">Compact Spatio-Temporal GRU</span><span class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant">42.8 KB recurrent cells for temporal speed/volume prediction with FP16 weights.</span></div><div class="p-space-xs bg-surface-container-low rounded border border-surface-container"><span class="font-semibold text-on-surface block">FedAvg (McMahan et al. 2017)</span><span class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant">Canonical weighted averaging over isolated local stochastic gradient descent steps.</span></div></div></div></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-space-lg"><div class="bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl p-space-lg shadow-sm space-y-space-md"><div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-space-xs"><div class="flex items-center gap-space-xs"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-[20px]">format_quote</span><h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface font-semibold">Academic Citations &amp; Reproducibility</h3></div><span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm font-mono text-on-tertiary-container">BIBTEX / APA</span></div><div class="bg-surface-container-low p-space-sm rounded-lg space-y-1 font-mono text-xs text-on-surface overflow-x-auto"><div class="text-on-surface-variant">// BibTeX Citation for AIORI-3 PS-003 Benchmark</div><div class="text-secondary">@article{fedtraffic2024ps003,</div><div class="pl-2 text-on-surface-variant">title={Decentralized Federated Edge Computing for Urban Traffic-Flow Telemetry},</div><div class="pl-2 text-on-surface-variant">author={UrbanPulse ITS Research Team},</div><div class="pl-2 text-on-surface-variant">journal={Smart Cities Federated Intelligence Portal},</div><div class="pl-2 text-on-surface-variant">volume={3}, pages={102--118}, year={2024}</div><div>}</div></div><div class="space-y-space-xs font-body-sm text-body-sm pt-space-xs"><div class="font-semibold text-on-surface text-xs uppercase tracking-wider">Reproducible CLI Execution Command:</div><div class="bg-surface-container-high p-space-sm rounded font-mono text-xs text-primary flex items-center justify-between"><span>python run_benchmark.py --seeds 42,128,256 --dirichlet 0.1 --clients 5 --quantize fp16</span><button class="text-secondary hover:text-on-surface transition-colors" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText('python run_benchmark.py --seeds 42,128,256 --dirichlet 0.1 --clients 5 --quantize fp16'); alert('Copied benchmark command to clipboard!');"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">content_copy</span></button></div></div><div class="pt-space-xs"><div class="p-space-sm bg-surface-container-low rounded flex items-center gap-space-xs text-on-surface-variant text-xs"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-secondary">info</span><span>All baseline algorithms reproduce deterministically across random seeds 42, 128, and 256. Zero proprietary camera feeds required.</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></main></div></body></html>